━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
+ SemanticDefault is Tuple

` A value written as the default of the type it is declared as, in one instance: where the value
` begins, where it and its type end, just past their last characters, and the name of the type.
+ line U32
+ column U32
+ end-line U32
+ end-column U32
+ type-end-line U32
+ type-end-column U32
+ type-name String

━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
+ SemanticOverwrite is Tuple

` An assignment at the start of a constructor's body to a property whose value the constructor
` built first, in one instance: where the assignment and its target begin, where the target ends,
` just past its last character, the property, the name of its type, and whether a `..` initializer
` can take the assignment's place.
+ line U32
+ column U32
+ target-line U32
+ target-column U32
+ target-end-column U32
+ name String
+ type-name String
+ actionable Bool

━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
+ SemanticCast is Tuple

` A cast to the type its place already takes the value as, in one instance: where it begins, the
` place (`context`), the name of the type cast to, the type as written, and whether the
` instance's function or its class takes type parameters.
+ line U32
+ column U32
+ context String
+ target String
+ written String
+ is-generic Bool

━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
+ SemanticSuffix is Tuple

+ line U32
+ column U32
+ end-line U32
+ end-column U32
+ unit String

━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
+ SemanticPayload is Tuple

` The payload of an event that has effects, in one instance: where it is written, the event's
` name, and its effects as the reference names them, the first one met first.
+ line U32
+ column U32
+ event String
+ effects String

━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
+ SemanticCaseOwner is Tuple

` A case given to a call by its symbol alone that functions the call may choose take as a case of
` more than one type, in one instance: where it is written, its name, the names of those types in
` order, and the name of the one the function chosen takes.
+ line U32
+ column U32
+ name String
+ owners [String]
+ chosen String

━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
+ SemanticFacts

` What the semantic rules read of one target file, gathered from every instance the roots that
` cover it typed.
+ defaults [SemanticDefault]
+ overwrites [SemanticOverwrite]
+ casts [SemanticCast]
+ suffixes [SemanticSuffix]
+ payloads [SemanticPayload]
+ case-owners [SemanticCaseOwner]

────────────────────
+ trace-count Size

defaults.length + overwrites.length + casts.length + later

.. later = suffixes.length + payloads.length + case-owners.length

────────────────────
+ This
